  "body": "The runnable workbench previously used 1,000 local presets even though the specification required 10,000. This PR makes 500 preset seed families × 20 deterministic variations the default, fixes duplicate IDs/zero-value/leader-ledger defects, and connects the six-screen A3 client to the validated server API with fresh decisions and original CSV/JSON/Markdown evidence exports.\n\nGoogle Cloud preview: https://thousand-stores-wva46uzo7a-du.a.run.app/rehearsal/\n\nDeployment: participant-approved project `h2gdm-hack26icn-2637`, service `thousand-stores`, revision `thousand-stores-00001-hzn`, deployed source `552b5dcde7d01c519029173559664d92a7b6a535`. Unauthenticated health, real 10,000-candidate execution and desktop/mobile UI passed 13 actual Cloud checks. The preview has no Gemini key configured.\n\nValidation:\n- Build/type checks and 126 active unit/HTTP checks pass; seven fixed external arithmetic cases pass without claiming a full independent oracle.\n- Actual local Chrome: 20 checks pass, including original downloads, leader-ledger/canvas agreement, zero-demand boundaries, input/in-flight freshness, blocked AI and 390px layout.\n- Actual Cloud: one preview POST returned DONE with 10,000 unique IDs and the correct source SHA; 13 checks pass. Its resource duration was 4,189.3 ms after initial GET checks, not a cold-start/percentile or two-second-path claim.\n- A 147.113-second local captured-screen montage with English narration and captions is prepared and saved privately to Library. It is not continuous live interaction, live AI execution or Cloud proof. No public video upload or final event submission was performed.\n- English project description, README, field sheet, checklist, scripts, Q&A, recording narration and verification summary are in docs/. The reviewed documentation revision is ccafd8a. Organizer requirements supplied by the participant: Google Cloud, English and 15:20 KST deadline.\n\nThe bounded server-only Gemini adapter requests 5×100 validated families with concurrency/time/response/call limits; only complete valid responses and measured usage permit the AI-family label. Provider I/O was mocked in tests. Live model calls: 0. Financial calibration/hidden holdout, full independent ledger coverage and AI-versus-random advantage remain unverified; business acceptance gates are preserved. Sensitivity intervals are checked at full-population endpoints but are not claimed to be globally minimal or exact boundaries. Raw public datasets, shared types and protected verifier tests/fixtures are unchanged.\n\nUser decision remains **PR only: do not merge main**. No final submission, messages, email or new automation was sent.\n\nBase main advanced during submission preparation. The PR is currently conflicting with that newer main; the reviewed submission branch and deployed SHA above remain pinned. No merge was attempted.\n",
